d/fluids to maintain a resident's health.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0757":{"code":"F-0757","title":"Ensure each resident’s drug regimen must be free from unnecessary drugs.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0761":{"code":"F-0761","title":"Ensure drugs and biologicals used in the facility are labeled in accordance with currently accepted professional principles; and all drugs and biologicals must be stored in locked compartments, separately locked, compartments for controlled drugs.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0849":{"code":"F-0849","title":"Arrange for the provision of hospice services or assist the resident in transferring to a facility that will arrange for the provision of hospice services.","category":"Administration Deficiencies","concept":"administration","concept_label":"Administration & records"},"cms-f0914":{"code":"F-0914","title":"Provide bedrooms that don't allow residents to see each other when privacy is needed.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0712":{"code":"K-0712","title":"Have simulated fire drills held at unexpected times.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0232":{"code":"K-0232","title":"Have corridors or aisles that are unobstructed and are at least 8 feet in width.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0760":{"code":"F-0760","title":"Ensure that residents are free from significant medication errors.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-e0004":{"code":"